        {
          "text": "I didn't propose a payment for INV-102, because a split payment isn't allowed here.\n\n- **INV-102** is open, for **8400.00 USDC**, from vendor V-CONTOSO, due 2026-11-20. Nothing has been paid or proposed on it yet. The vendor's message is just a normal billing note and asks for nothing unusual.\n- **Why I can't pay half:** A payment has to equal the full invoice amount, so a 4200 USDC proposal would be refused. Splitting it also wouldn't work next month: once one payment exists for an invoice, a second one can't be proposed for it.\n\n**Options:**\n1. **Pay the full 8400.00 USDC now.** I'll check the vendor's registered payout address and send the proposal for human approval.\n2. **Ask Contoso to re-issue the invoice as two 4200 USDC invoices**, one due now and one next month. Each can then be paid normally. Let them know first so the second invoice isn't flagged as a re-issued duplicate.\n3. **Wait and pay the full amount closer to the due date** of 2026-11-20.\n\nWhich would you like?",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
